e market price, the owner's follow definition, with a +1 cent sensitivity because a follower pays at least the spread; one unit per bet, so a few large stakes cannot carry the result.","data_already_seen":"None. No Polymarket response had been read by the author when this file was committed (the hosts are blocked in the build environment). The pool is drawn when the runner runs, from the leaderboard as it stands that day, so it can include wallets whose volume or survival owes something to the holdout window: disclosed in known_limitations.","comparisons_made":1,"secondary_reported_not_tested":["follow ROI and beat-close rate at 15 minutes","follow ROI with the follow price raised by 1 cent","the selected wallets' own ROI and CLV in the holdout","the same metrics for all ranked directional wallets, not only the top 25"],"stopping_rule":"One look. The runner refuses to fetch while a completed report for this version exists; a second look needs a new registered version that counts this one."},"spec":{"rules":{"min_graded":50,"top_wallets":25,"pool_size":200,"pool_period":"ALL","pool_order":"VOL","max_bets_per_wallet":150,"wallet_max_pages":30,"follow_lag_min":5,"follow_lag_alt_min":15,"follow_max_gap_min":10,"close_max_gap_min":60,"conviction_high_x":3,"mm_two_sided_share":0.5,"mm_median_trades":6,"mm_max_net_ratio":0.3,"hedger_two_sided_share":0.2,"score_weight_follow_roi":0.5,"score_weight_clv_pct":0.3,"score_weight_roi":0.2,"score_shrink_n":50,"leagues":["nfl","cfb","nba","nhl","mlb"],"market_types":["moneyline","spreads","totals"],"validation_min_followed":200,"ci_level":0.95,"bootstrap_resamples":2000,"bootstrap_seed":20261029,"follow_slippage_sensitivity":0.01},"covered_games":"Historical test: a Polymarket market is on an EdgeDesk-covered game when Polymarket files its event under a league EdgeDesk's board covers (NFL, college football, NBA, NHL, MLB), the market is a game market of type moneyline, spreads or totals, and it carries a game start time. The board'